    name         type    format    label      Variable label
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
_ego            str3    %9s                   
_alter          str3    %9s                   
glasgow1        byte    %10.0g                
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Sorted by: _ego  _alter

. list in 1/5

     +--------------------------+
     | _ego   _alter   glasgow1 |
     |--------------------------|
  1. |   n1       n1          . |
  2. |   n1      n10          0 |
